      "description": "✅Specifications:\n❤️Product Type:Oatmeal Cup Breakfast Spoon Portable Sealed Glass Mason Bottle Milk Oatmeal Cup Water Bottle\n❤️Material: lead-free glass\n❤️Capacity: 350ml\n❤️Size: diameter 8.5cm, height 12.5cm\n❤️Uses: home storage bowls, can be used for yogurt, dessert, fruit, snacks, and so on.\n\n\n✅Features:\n⭐ Lead-free glass is healthy and safe, safe to use, and has good permeability. Even if the lid is closed, the remaining volume of the transparent bottle is clear at a glance. \n⭐Just four steps, a simple and delicious breakfast is out~\n1. Pour milk into a cup with oats\n2. Close the sealed lid to isolate the outside air\n3. Store in the refrigerator overnight. The oatmeal in the soaked cup will taste better\n4. Add yogurt and your favorite fruits the next morning and you're done\n\n\n✅Package Included:\n💁 * 1 x bottle with spoon\n",
